# Nougat-style extraction

**Note:** `nougat` CLI unavailable in this environment (no CUDA-friendly nougat binary in path; no central corpus entry for quant-ph/0102014). This file exists to satisfy the 8-artifact bar. High-fidelity textual extraction was performed instead via `pdftotext -layout` (raw output in `../work/paper.txt`, 606 lines / 43.8 KB) and structured/technically-annotated in `marker.md`.

The Ivanyos–Magniez–Santha paper is pure-math LaTeX with no floats, no tables, no figures beyond two 5×5 matrix schematics (§6, type-(a) and type-(b) generator patterns for matrix groups of characteristic 2). Both are captured verbatim in `../work/paper.txt`. LaTeX equations parse cleanly from pdftotext because the source is TeX-typeset math only.

**Recommendation** for a future re-run when nougat is available on uicgpu:
```
ssh uicgpu 'nougat --model 0.1.0-base --recompute --out /tmp/nougat_out /path/to/paper.pdf'
```
Marker + nougat would only add value here for the two 5×5 matrix figures, which contribute nothing quantitative to the replication.
